<%#
# Key: output/format/tool_result
# Purpose: Plain-text tool-result transcript.
# Used: Sent in place of a native tool-result block when its tool call is rendered as output/format/tool_call.
# Locals:
# - name: Name of the Tool that produced the result, or an empty string when its call is not in the request.
# - id: Provider call identifier of the call this result answers.
# - error: True when the Tool reported a failure.
# - output: Tool output text.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
# - This output is embedded inside a larger model-visible message.
# - Keep the wording consistent with output/format/tool_call so calls and results pair up.
-%>
[Tool result<% unless name.empty? %> from <%= name %><% end %> (id: <%= id %><% if error %>, error<% end %>)]
<%= output %>
